PE 800: Hybrid Integers / 混合整数

=== Definition ===
Hybrid integer: p^q * q^p where p ≠ q are primes.
Examples: 2^3 * 3^2 = 72, 2^5 * 5^2 = 800

=== Verification of given values ===
  C(800) = 2 (expected 2) ✓
  Hybrid integers ≤ 800:
    2^3 * 3^2 = 72
    2^5 * 5^2 = 800
    11^23 * 23^11 = 4744352777287167957
    17^23 * 23^17 = 2308992742161249191

  C(800^800): using log method...
  Primes up to 7725: 980
  Result: 10790 (expected 10790) ✓

=== Small bound verification ===
  N=100: brute=1
  N=1000: brute=2
  N=10000: brute=3
